  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Assistance to Build Resilience against HPAI in The Gambia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of the project are: To minimize the threat posed to human health and livelihood by HPAI outbreak among wild birds in The Gambia; To prepare for, control, and respond to an influenza epidemic; To build the capacity of government institutions as well as civil society organizations active in the poultry value chain to operationalize Good Emergency Management Practices; To put in place adequate bio-security measures</narrative>
  </description>
